 "notes": "<h3>Living, dining &amp; kitchen</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>Sofa on the kitchen wall,</b> chaise toward dining as a soft divider, keeping the balcony door clear. Modular, so Mirror flips the chaise.</li>\n        <li><b>TV stand on the office wall,</b> facing the sofa, about 2.2 m from the seat.</li>\n        <li><b>Coffee table</b> about 30 cm from the sofa, with about 78 cm to walk past the TV.</li>\n        <li><b>Dining table</b> clear of the entrance door, with about 83 cm of path into the living area.</li>\n        <li><b>Shoe rack</b> just past the entrance door swing. <b>Bookshelf</b> on the dining wall by the corridor.</li>\n        <li><b>Kitchen shelf unit</b> below the kitchen door, about 68 cm from the L-shaped counter.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>Master bedroom</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>Wardrobe (to buy)</b> in the top-left recess, drawn at the size to shop for: up to 140 cm wide and 60 cm deep, with a small gap at the sides and back. Confirm the recess on site before buying.</li>\n        <li><b>Bed</b> headboard on the outer wall, reachable from both sides, with about 1.3 m in front of the wardrobe to open its doors.</li>\n        <li><b>Bookshelf 2</b> as a bedside shelf on one side of the bed, <b>bedstand</b> on the other, both against the headboard wall.</li>\n        <li><b>Bookshelf 1</b> on the utility platform wall, shifted along to free the corner for the bedstand and still clear of the utility door.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>Daughter's room</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>Wardrobe</b> beside the door, <b>bed</b> along the master bedroom wall, <b>bedside table</b> by the window.</li>\n        <li><b>Piano</b> on the office wall, facing the bed, with about 75 cm between them for the bench. It sits just past the door swing.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>Office</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>Desk</b> along the wall shared with your daughter's room, side-lit by the window, with 75 cm of chair space. <b>Bookshelf 3</b> behind you.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>Helper's room</h3>\n      <ul><li><b>Helper bed</b> (175 × 80 cm) along the long wall away from the door, head at the far end. Its foot reaches into the door swing, so it shows red: the door opens to about 50°, leaving a passage of roughly 65 cm. A door rehung to open outward, or a folding door, would clear it fully.</li>\n        <li>Keep the wall cabinet by the door reachable: nothing tall in front of it.</li></ul>"
